{"parse": {"title": "DPL-07", "pageid": 69802, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/DPL-06\" title=\"DPL-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">DPL-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/DPL-08\" title=\"DPL-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">DPL</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B9.98.E6.B3.95.E8.BD.B4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"乘法轴\">乘法轴</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 乘法轴</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Logarithmic Axis</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>1<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>2<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span>而<span class=\"color-value\"></span>接<span class=\"color-value\"></span>下<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>当<span class=\"color-value\"></span>然<span class=\"color-value\"></span>该<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>3<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191707</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-xingkong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"xingkong\"><img alt=\"xingkong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-xingkong.png/600px-Cg-xingkong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-xingkong.png/900px-Cg-xingkong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-xingkong.png/1200px-Cg-xingkong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>——小梅斯梅尔给我讲了那个关于海王星的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-306612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-306612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-306612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>依照引力理论那条精巧的公式，人们发现了天王星。但随后……他们却发现，天王星并没有完全按照计算得出的轨迹运行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-306612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-306612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-306612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>他们开始怀疑，难道理论出错了？这条定理难道并不正确？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306618.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-306618.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306618.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306618.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-306618.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306618.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-306618.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306618.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>一些人开始否认，一些人选择逃避，但仍然有一些人选择了去直面这件事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306618.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-306618.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306618.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306618.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-306618.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306618.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-306618.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306618.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>他们想要证明他们所相信的是正确的，于是他们做了一个假设——如果引力理论没有出错呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>如果说天王星轨迹的偏差，是另外一颗人们尚未发现的第八颗行星引起的呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>这个证明没有那么难。天文学家依照计算出来的结果，在一个午夜将天文望远镜指向了纸上计算出的那个方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>——然后他们就发现了海王星。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>我很喜欢这个故事。我想，我似乎稍微能够理解人们所喜欢的“浪漫”的意思了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>人们会因为一时的好恶做出令我难以理解的决定，但那些看似毫无道理的决定背后，也许其实是存在逻辑的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>小梅斯梅尔说，人们有着自己所爱的事物，人们有着自己相信的事物。所以当他们在现象世界中发现了符合这些标准的事物时，便会感到高兴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>我想我可以理解为：人们做了他们的假设。当那些假设得到证明、当他们发现符合规律的结果时，他们便会为其赋予特殊的含义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>它看不见，摸不着。就像是数字存在于万事万物之中，无法被触碰，但的确存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>它们都连接着那个我们所向往的超越的世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>我们也经常会做各种各样的假设，有的时候我们能够证明假设为真，发现一条新的定理；但有的时候现实却会对我们说“不，你错了”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>我很开心冰淇淋们没有对我说“不”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>这个关于冰淇淋的课题给了我一个重要的启发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>我带着我的问题从乘法轴来到了加法轴，我将乘号变成加号，将我手中的数字变为对应的加数，然后……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>应该带着我的和，跳回乘法轴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>多么简单的答案。我早该想到谜底的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>我想我逐渐能够看到我那下一个格子的轮廓了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>在那之后，当我的研究进度停滞时，我都会到博物馆散心。那里比不上我们的沙滩，但也不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>冰淇淋店的主人很感谢我们，每次我过去的时候，她都想要用免费的冰淇淋招待我们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>但我解决了许多科算中心里研究员们发布的委托，赚取了足够多的点数。所以我可以为自己付账，还会请大家伙一起吃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>“奇迹之星”口味的冰淇淋在特别展览结束后就下架了。但我并不介意，我最喜欢的是巧克力口味的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>冰淇淋真的是非常好的东西，它漂亮的几何形状能够帮助我整理思绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>所以每次我去博物馆的时候，都会选择吃下最合适数量的冰淇淋——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>别客气，尽量吃！还有很多呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>我会的。我从不拒绝免费的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这证明了什么呢？好人有好报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>您好，两位？你们就这样接受了37请客的冰淇淋，不会觉得害臊吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>不会啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……是我的错。你当然不会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>但话说回来，冰淇淋实际上并不是个我们会推荐“尽量吃”的东西，小心吃坏肚子，37。我如果没记错，你已经吃了不止一个了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>别担心，这只是今天的第3支。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>单体和二元构成了三体，它代表着节制与谨慎的美德。三个冰淇淋显然不能被形容是很多的或是不合时宜的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我认为4是一个更合适的数字。它是正整数中最小的合数，是“最大的奇迹”、“最完美的数字”！显然4更适合作为我们最终的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你是说你还要再吃一个？我不建议你这么做。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>为什么？显然4比3更好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>我觉得“10”更好，它是在十进制中最小的两位数，当你把它写在十位的位置上时，它的数字值只有1！听起来多棒！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>但只是友善地提醒一下：这个休息区是没有厕所的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我常常会在那里碰到小梅斯梅尔、X、兔毛手袋和爱兹拉，他们都是很有意思的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>和他们在一起的时候，常常让我想到从前我们和苏菲亚，偶尔还有210共同度过的时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>有的时候可燃点和沙丝绒也会到这里来，他们是爱兹拉的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>可燃点是个总充满活力的正整数，而沙丝绒和小梅斯梅尔有些相似，是个有时候会对自己很严格的分数。她们也都是很有趣的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>但……某一天，我们得到了一个坏的消息。一个很坏很坏的坏消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>现象世界的一切都是不确凿、不稳定的。我本应该早就知道这件事了，但在听闻这个消息的时候，我还是有些失落——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>嘿，打扰下，年轻人们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>我就是来告诉你们一声，其实……这家冰淇淋店还是要关了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>啊？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>……说什么胡话呢？看看这条长队，你已经不必倒闭了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>是的，我不必倒闭了。但……我做了一个数学运算，就像是这个小姑娘教给我的那样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>我最近每天赚得不少，但等过了这个劲，营业额就不会这么高了。即使每天入账一个不错的数字，收回成本也需要两年多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>所以我就想，为什么不把这个铺子转出去呢？就像是别人对我做的那样。趁着现在这个铺子火，转掉它我就能一口气收回本了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>………………听起来你改变了自己的思考方式，提升了自己的序列。这是……这应当是一件好事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>没错，冰淇淋店要关了。我即将没有冰淇淋吃了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我再也见不到那些美丽的十二角星了，这真是一件让人伤心的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>但……这还不是最糟的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>……所以，是这个意思咯？折腾了半天，以后我还是没有冰淇淋吃？你不要你的梦想了吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>但不得不说，这是一个非常理智的判断。别害怕女士，我支持你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>店主小姐，如果那边那位蛮不讲理的客人对您进行了任何人身威胁，您可以联系那边的馆长先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>嘿爱兹拉！这符合规定吗？做点什么！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>转让店铺并不违反合约，我不能在这种地方滥用职权。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>那我之后出来遛弯的时候吃什么？那些路过的参观客吗？嘿，接了你店的人要在这里做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>我听说他要在这里卖怪味豆。就是那种有招潮蟹味、厄难种子味、蜗牛眼珠味的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>谁会想吃蜗牛眼珠味的怪味豆！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我们不能吃豆子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>……啊？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>什么，你老家的什么宗教教义让你们不能吃豆子吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>当然！吃豆子是罪大恶极的，没有比吃豆子更坏的恶行了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>如果有人吃了豆子，他是要被处以极刑的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>这……抱歉，我无意冒犯，但这听起来似乎有些过于严苛了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……考虑到你们并非学派中人，而且这里已经不是在岛上了，我不会要求你们吃了豆子就要去死的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>但我是不会吃的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……真可惜，这样美丽的冰淇淋，居然要变成邪恶的豆子了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>可你在吃巧克力味的冰淇淋，那不也是豆子吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>巧克力味的冰淇淋是用巧克力做的。巧克力是用可可豆做的。可可豆是豆子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>由此可证——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>你吃了豆子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>………………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>不。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>这不可能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……这不可能！如果我真的吃了豆子，那……那我就应该已经被阿其翁叼走了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>但我没有被阿其翁叼走！这个结果矛盾了，所以只有一个可能，假设是不正确的！你一定是骗我的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>37，你的冰淇淋流下来了！先擦一下，我带了手帕……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>快救救可怜的冰淇淋，放心，它们不是豆子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>你相信吗？相信这家伙？也许你的阿其翁只是在赶来的路上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我们可以安静一会儿吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>嘿，说要在店铺转让前采访我的记者来了，你们要来一起照一张相吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>就是那几位，他们就是帮助我一起缔造了这场冰淇淋奇迹的年轻研究者们——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_at_ys_bingqilin2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_at_ys_bingqilin2\"><img alt=\"2_2_at_ys_bingqilin2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-2_2_at_ys_bingqilin2.png/600px-Cg-2_2_at_ys_bingqilin2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-2_2_at_ys_bingqilin2.png/900px-Cg-2_2_at_ys_bingqilin2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-2_2_at_ys_bingqilin2.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_at_ys_bingqilin2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>——我的假设是对的，兔毛手袋在骗人。巧克力冰淇淋不是豆子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>的确，可可豆里面带有一个“豆”字，但它其实是梧桐科，而不是豆科。更何况从可可豆到巧克力冰淇淋是经过了加工的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>就好像是我们拿到了一个很坏很坏的负的无限不循环小数，它看起来是-1.414213562373……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>它不能写作两个整数之比，小数点之后的数字也永远写不完。看起来坏透了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>但如果我们试着计算它的平方——它是2！我们就会得到一个很好的数字！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>所以巧克力冰淇淋没有任何问题，那是很好的东西。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_at_ys_bingqilin1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_at_ys_bingqilin1\"><img alt=\"2_2_at_ys_bingqilin1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/Cg-2_2_at_ys_bingqilin1.png/600px-Cg-2_2_at_ys_bingqilin1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/Cg-2_2_at_ys_bingqilin1.png/900px-Cg-2_2_at_ys_bingqilin1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/Cg-2_2_at_ys_bingqilin1.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_at_ys_bingqilin1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>我希望你也能尝尝，我委托星锑帮我带了一份给你。随信一起的是我收集的论文、期刊剪报、打印下来的资料等，你可以使用这些更新岛上的数据库。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>我还收集到了许多外界数学家最新提出来的谜题，有些非常有趣，我对其中一些已经有了思路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>但公平起见，我会给你留出同样的时间挑战它们的。我们可以在下一次的信里交流彼此的想法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>还有这张“报纸”。小梅斯梅尔发现了这则报道，建议我可以一起寄给你，这样你就可以直观地观测到我的状态。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>——简而言之，我过得很好，课题也在推进中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>这一次我一定会算出更好的答案。也许它不会是最好的，但必须是足够好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>然后我会回到岛上，苏菲亚也会回来。我们将共享真理投下的辉光，就像从前那样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>也许你注意到了，这封信的总字数是一个回文数，我相信你明白我的意思。回信的字数不要太少，否则那就是作弊了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">一封远渡重洋的回信：</div><div>我期待着你的回信。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随着信纸上最后一笔的落下，写信人成功完成了她在最后所宣告的目标。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无需回过头来再去计数，读信者确认这一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">6：</div><div>……呵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>青年露出了展开信纸后第一个明显的表情。而在场的另一个人显然没有错过这一幕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302504.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-302504.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302504.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302504.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-302504.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302504.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-302504.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302504.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>哇哦……你刚才这是笑了吗？老天爷，我还以为你那个惨白表情是焊死在脸上的呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>星锑……！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "DPL-07"}}